{"logId": "9749aca3-b518-478a-b4bf-98d1dedd07fd", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [863, 136, 1083, 210], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[863.0, 136.0], [1083.0, 136.0], [1083.0, 210.0], [863.0, 210.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "三年亲情", "block_bbox": [240, 227, 453, 282], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 227.0], [453.0, 227.0], [453.0, 282.0], [240.0, 282.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：电器部/袁银芳", "block_bbox": [294, 293, 452, 315], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[294.0, 293.0], [451.0, 293.0], [451.0, 314.0], [294.0, 314.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "姨，你好！", "block_bbox": [250, 370, 370, 396], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[250.0, 370.0], [370.0, 370.0], [370.0, 396.0], [250.0, 396.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "“银芳，你前几天旅游啦！我来找你没有见到你。”", "block_bbox": [200, 406, 607, 465], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 406.0], [607.0, 406.0], [607.0, 465.0], [200.0, 465.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "公司组织集体旅游，我去青岛玩了两天。\n咱俩有2个月没有见面了吧，您身体可好？有需要\n帮忙的吗？\n“我的心脏病复发住医院了，我今天来就是问问你，我用微波炉炖肉的方法对不对，我还想再买个电磁炉。”", "block_bbox": [199, 473, 617, 567], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 473.0], [617.0, 473.0], [617.0, 567.0], [199.0, 567.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [198, 575, 976, 635], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 575.0], [976.0, 575.0], [976.0, 635.0], [198.0, 635.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [673, 240, 1092, 556], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[673.0, 240.0], [1092.0, 240.0], [1092.0, 556.0], [673.0, 556.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我给阿姨讲了微波炉调火力炖肉和用菜单炖肉怎样操作，又用纸给她记录下，因为阿姨80多岁了，以防回家忘了，所以每次我给她讲机器操作之后再用纸条给她记下来，几年下来，阿姨的小包里可以拿出一叠我给她记录的小纸条。讲了微波炉，我又领姨去买了一台电磁炉，临走的时候姨说：“银芳，你真有耐心，讲解得仔细，你给我介绍的微波炉，电饭煲，豆浆机都好用，价格不贵，质量也好，你对我真好，我们都3年的交情了，以后我来胖东来买东西还找你，你哪天休息了到我们家来做客吧！我给你用微波炉做自己拿手的好菜。”", "block_bbox": [198, 643, 976, 841], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 643.0], [976.0, 643.0], [976.0, 841.0], [198.0, 841.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "是啊！我们都有3年的交情了，记得2005年春节前一天，我正在给一位顾客介绍搞活动的一款美的微波炉（电脑操作板），这位阿姨走了过来。我与她打了招呼后一直在讲解，前一位顾客成交之后，阿姨说，我本来不想要电脑操作板的，听了你细心的讲解，我感觉这一款机器操作也很简单，我也要一台这款的。于是，我又给她讲了一遍，姨买了微波炉，满意地回家了。", "block_bbox": [197, 848, 976, 1010], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 848.0], [976.0, 848.0], [976.0, 1010.0], [197.0, 1010.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "之后，姨几乎每天都来找我，让我教她一天做一个菜，讲完之后，我再用纸把步骤写下来，方便她回家操作。不知不觉3年过去了，现在每次阿姨走进商场，同事就会对我说：“银芳，你姨来啦！”新同事都认为是我亲姨。", "block_bbox": [198, 1017, 976, 1113], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 1017.0], [976.0, 1017.0], [976.0, 1113.0], [198.0, 1113.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "这位可亲友善的姨让我明白：工作中一定要有耐心，不急不燥，做到细心讲解、服务周到，把顾客当上帝来尊敬，当作亲人关心，做到人到、心到、感情到。这是我们胖东来人特有的一种精神和服务理念，也只有这样才能赢得顾客的信任，才能让我们在工作中也多一分浓浓的亲情。", "block_bbox": [198, 1119, 976, 1249], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 1119.0], [976.0, 1119.0], [976.0, 1249.0], [198.0, 1249.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "心灵最深处的纯净", "block_bbox": [111, 1407, 401, 1448], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [401.0, 1407.0], [401.0, 1448.0], [111.0, 1448.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1001, 637, 1137, 725], "block_id": 13, "block_order": null, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[1001.0, 637.0], [1137.0, 637.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1001.0, 725.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.8122721910476685, "coordinate": [863, 136, 1083, 210], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[863.0, 136.0], [1083.0, 136.0], [1083.0, 210.0], [863.0, 210.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.8575231432914734, "coordinate": [240, 227, 453, 282], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 227.0], [453.0, 227.0], [453.0, 282.0], [240.0, 282.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7976188659667969, "coordinate": [294, 293, 452, 315], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[294.0, 293.0], [451.0, 293.0], [451.0, 314.0], [294.0, 314.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7709411382675171, "coordinate": [250, 370, 370, 396], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[250.0, 370.0], [370.0, 370.0], [370.0, 396.0], [250.0, 396.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9004958868026733, "coordinate": [200, 406, 607, 465], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[200.0, 406.0], [607.0, 406.0], [607.0, 465.0], [200.0, 465.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9293386936187744, "coordinate": [199, 473, 617, 567], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 473.0], [617.0, 473.0], [617.0, 567.0], [199.0, 567.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.866344153881073, "coordinate": [673, 240, 1092, 556], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[673.0, 240.0], [1092.0, 240.0], [1092.0, 556.0], [673.0, 556.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9176515340805054, "coordinate": [198, 575, 976, 635], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 575.0], [976.0, 575.0], [976.0, 635.0], [198.0, 635.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9603219628334045, "coordinate": [198, 643, 976, 841], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 643.0], [976.0, 643.0], [976.0, 841.0], [198.0, 841.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9559507966041565, "coordinate": [197, 848, 976, 1010], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 848.0], [976.0, 848.0], [976.0, 1010.0], [197.0, 1010.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9470259547233582, "coordinate": [198, 1017, 976, 1113], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 1017.0], [976.0, 1017.0], [976.0, 1113.0], [198.0, 1113.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.953181266784668, "coordinate": [198, 1119, 976, 1249], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 1119.0], [976.0, 1119.0], [976.0, 1249.0], [198.0, 1249.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8134098052978516, "coordinate": [111, 1407, 401, 1448], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[111.0, 1407.0], [401.0, 1407.0], [401.0, 1448.0], [111.0, 1448.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6628271341323853, "coordinate": [1001, 637, 1137, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1001.0, 637.0], [1137.0, 637.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1001.0, 725.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 三年亲情\n\n作者：电器部/袁银芳\n\n姨，你好！\n\n“银芳，你前几天旅游啦！我来找你没有见到你。”\n\n公司组织集体旅游，我去青岛玩了两天。\n\n咱俩有2个月没有见面了吧，您身体可好？有需要\n\n帮忙的吗？\n\n“我的心脏病复发住医院了，我今天来就是问问你，我用微波炉炖肉的方法对不对，我还想再买个电磁炉。”\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_673_240_1092_556.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"35%\" /></div>\n\n\n我给阿姨讲了微波炉调火力炖肉和用菜单炖肉怎样操作，又用纸给她记录下，因为阿姨80多岁了，以防回家忘了，所以每次我给她讲机器操作之后再用纸条给她记下来，几年下来，阿姨的小包里可以拿出一叠我给她记录的小纸条。讲了微波炉，我又领姨去买了一台电磁炉，临走的时候姨说：“银芳，你真有耐心，讲解得仔细，你给我介绍的微波炉，电饭煲，豆浆机都好用，价格不贵，质量也好，你对我真好，我们都3年的交情了，以后我来胖东来买东西还找你，你哪天休息了到我们家来做客吧！我给你用微波炉做自己拿手的好菜。”\n\n是啊！我们都有3年的交情了，记得2005年春节前一天，我正在给一位顾客介绍搞活动的一款美的微波炉（电脑操作板），这位阿姨走了过来。我与她打了招呼后一直在讲解，前一位顾客成交之后，阿姨说，我本来不想要电脑操作板的，听了你细心的讲解，我感觉这一款机器操作也很简单，我也要一台这款的。于是，我又给她讲了一遍，姨买了微波炉，满意地回家了。\n\n之后，姨几乎每天都来找我，让我教她一天做一个菜，讲完之后，我再用纸把步骤写下来，方便她回家操作。不知不觉3年过去了，现在每次阿姨走进商场，同事就会对我说：“银芳，你姨来啦！”新同事都认为是我亲姨。\n\n这位可亲友善的姨让我明白：工作中一定要有耐心，不急不燥，做到细心讲解、服务周到，把顾客当上帝来尊敬，当作亲人关心，做到人到、心到、感情到。这是我们胖东来人特有的一种精神和服务理念，也只有这样才能赢得顾客的信任，才能让我们在工作中也多一分浓浓的亲情。\n\n## 心灵最深处的纯净\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_637_1137_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_863_136_1083_210.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9749aca3-b518-478a-b4bf-98d1dedd07fd/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_863_136_1083_210.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A43%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2F398e56142e296be951f39a602049e2b23573616cde087777923425a66b0800cb", "imgs/img_in_image_box_673_240_1092_556.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9749aca3-b518-478a-b4bf-98d1dedd07fd/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_673_240_1092_556.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A43%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2F528673d27dddc62746e4d6659d0faaabea01fc17bc6b4b98c0c03c48612dd843", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_637_1137_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9749aca3-b518-478a-b4bf-98d1dedd07fd/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_637_1137_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A43%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2Faaca10c04392337b5ea46ed3d711e94f630fb4974f40fbe34a1adfd9be9c9007"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9749aca3-b518-478a-b4bf-98d1dedd07fd/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A43%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2F2d43797d52a831b0b1b9177a41528ffd717febe6d8d82111563e52e35addf155"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9749aca3-b518-478a-b4bf-98d1dedd07fd/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A43%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2F709aced33b05375912c2c7c4b52e609f1b9976f21c7ff3a3805afaf07c86bd4c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//9749aca3-b518-478a-b4bf-98d1dedd07fd/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A43%3A33Z%2F-1%2F%2F4fcb99859dee1ea829f99bac11b416ee35f8a67637683de966b4d0c230d2a4b4"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
